# Geppetto registry fixture: a barrel prop (rectangular prism, 8 vertices, 6 quad faces).
# Distinct from crate.mdl (different path, extension and prop type) so the
# registry tests can tell the two models apart by search and by placement.
o barrel
v -0.4 -0.4 -0.6
v 0.4 -0.4 -0.6
v 0.4 0.4 -0.6
v -0.4 0.4 -0.6
v -0.4 -0.4 0.6
v 0.4 -0.4 0.6
v 0.4 0.4 0.6
v -0.4 0.4 0.6
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 8 7 6
f 1 5 6 2
f 2 6 7 3
f 3 7 8 4
f 4 8 5 1
